00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:03,950
So it's finally starting.

2
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:08,520
Unlike the group stage, this will now be a full knockout tournament.

3
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:11,330
If you lose once, everything is over.

4
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:13,420
Every match is decisive.

5
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:17,060
And no team is weak.

6
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:19,030
All matches will be tough.

7
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:23,640
Hello, Wakabayashi-kun?

8
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:24,710
Hey, Tsubasa.

9
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:29,840
First of all, thank you for advancing from the group as you promised.

10
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,920
You guys did a great job too.

11
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:32,840
Yes!

12
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:36,000
Wakabayashi-kun, how is your injury?

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,810
It's largely healed, but it looks like I can only play in one match.

14
00:00:41,810 --> 00:00:43,060
Only one match?!

15
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:47,560
Yes. If I'm going to play one match, it will of course be...

16
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,900
The final, right?

17
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:53,780
I believe that all of you can make it to the final together.

18
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:55,570
Okay, understood.

19
00:00:55,570 --> 00:01:00,360
Yesterday we also promised together that we would win this tournament.

20
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:01,280
Yes!

21
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:04,540
So we'll be counting on you in the final, Wakabayashi-kun.

22
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:06,640
Okay. See you.

23
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:09,920
Genzo, are you going no matter what?

24
00:01:10,670 --> 00:01:11,500
Yes.

