00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:47,560
Episode 18:
Here Come the Finals

50
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:47,560
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

51
00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:46,620
The first day of the qualifiers.

52
00:02:46,620 --> 00:02:50,350
Every strong opponent found its place here.

53
00:02:50,350 --> 00:02:54,910
The North Hokkaido representative, led by Captain Matsuyama...

54
00:02:54,910 --> 00:02:58,530
...Furano Elementary, was the first team to advance.

55
00:02:59,530 --> 00:03:06,200
The star of Tokyo representative Musashi FC, Misugi, advanced while waiting on the bench.

56
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:10,000
Saitama representative Meiwa FC...

57
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:14,880
...had a hat trick scored by Hyuga Kojiro in the first half.

58
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:24,950
With Tsubasa taking the goal king title, it showed how ambitious his team is for the championship.

59
00:03:24,950 --> 00:03:27,500
But in their 3rd match...

60
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:33,190
...Nankatsu SC encountered an unexpectedly tough team.

61
00:03:33,190 --> 00:03:35,060
Come on, Tsubasa!

62
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,400
Again?

63
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:44,780
His shot was saved again!

64
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:50,740
Nakanishi-kun hasn't conceded a single goal in the qualifiers!

65
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:53,540
He appears to be the number one goalkeeper of the tournament!

66
00:03:53,540 --> 00:03:55,430
Is this true, Manabu?

67
00:03:55,430 --> 00:04:00,480
Osaka representative Naniwa FC didn't concede a goal and didn't lose a match in their 5 group games.

68
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:05,230
A surprise team that defeated strong opponents with their incredibly strong defense.

69
00:04:05,230 --> 00:04:06,800
What did you say?!

70
00:04:10,140 --> 00:04:13,820
Even though you've scored many goals until now...

71
00:04:13,820 --> 00:04:16,560
...I won't let you score any today!

72
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,020
Hear what I say!

73
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:22,440
This year, I'm aiming not to concede a goal, just like Wakabayashi did last year!

74
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,780
What?!

75
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:25,490
Go! Forward!

76
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:28,160
Nakanishi-kun sends a long ball!

77
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:31,540
The ball keeps rising higher and higher!

78
00:04:31,540 --> 00:04:32,540
What?!

79
00:04:32,540 --> 00:04:36,500
W-What is this?! It's going directly to Nankatsu's goal!

80
00:04:37,210 --> 00:04:40,880
Caught unprepared, Nankatsu's goal defense is empty!

81
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:43,090
Alright! That's it!

82
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:47,320
Goal!

83
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:51,600
Number 11 Marui-kun from Naniwa scores with a header!

84
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:55,480
It was a swift counter-attack!

85
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:59,850
Nakanishi-kun also made a very powerful kick.

86
00:04:59,850 --> 00:05:03,480
A kick strong enough to compete with adults.

87
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:06,460
Damn it! What monstrous power!

88
00:05:06,460 --> 00:05:07,590
But it's only one goal!

89
00:05:07,590 --> 00:05:08,880
Let's keep our morale up and continue!

90
00:05:08,880 --> 00:05:09,660
Yes!

91
00:05:10,230 --> 00:05:11,030
But...

92
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:12,790
Take it!

93
00:05:14,910 --> 00:05:19,290
Naniwa's goalkeeper Nakanishi was protecting the goal by forming an incredible wall!

94
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:22,460
What?!

95
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:27,760
Come on, forward once more!

96
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:30,470
Alright! One more!

97
00:05:32,330 --> 00:05:35,430
They jump and intercept this long pass!

98
00:05:36,170 --> 00:05:39,140
The one intercepting is the tournament's shining Misaki-kun!

99
00:05:39,140 --> 00:05:40,810
There it is, Misaki!

100
00:05:40,810 --> 00:05:41,770
Damn.

101
00:05:41,770 --> 00:05:45,780
Now Misaki-kun advances by dribbling.

102
00:05:45,780 --> 00:05:50,580
All our shots so far have been aimed directly at him from close range.

103
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:54,490
But with this body, he must be slow to move to the corners!

104
00:05:54,490 --> 00:05:58,000
Misaki-kun takes a mid-range shot to the bottom corner!

105
00:05:59,140 --> 00:06:02,350
What?! He jumped there with incredible agility!

106
00:06:04,380 --> 00:06:08,920
Th-This is truly a brilliant performance like in Wakabayashi-kun's heyday...

107
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,680
...Nakanishi Taichi-kun!

108
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:13,430
I told you I wouldn't concede a goal!

109
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:15,930
I am the number one goalkeeper of this tournament!

110
00:06:15,930 --> 00:06:17,570
Amazing.

111
00:06:17,570 --> 00:06:18,990
What are you saying?!

112
00:06:18,990 --> 00:06:20,940
Save those words for after you win!

113
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:22,540
Tsubasa-kun...

114
00:06:22,540 --> 00:06:23,750
Everything is fine.

115
00:06:23,750 --> 00:06:24,600
What?

116
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:29,280
No matter how strong he is, there's no better goalkeeper than Wakabayashi-kun.

117
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,860
Wakabayashi-san!

118
00:06:30,860 --> 00:06:35,080
Yes, there's definitely no better goalkeeper than Wakabayashi-kun.

119
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:37,500
This time I'll definitely score and prove that!

120
00:06:37,500 --> 00:06:42,040
This time they're on the attack with goalkeeper Nakanishi-kun launching a long ball!

121
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:44,170
Damn it! They're underestimating us!

122
00:06:44,170 --> 00:06:46,170
Takayanagi, pass to the left!

123
00:06:46,170 --> 00:06:47,880
Okay!

124
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:50,010
Shirai, send the ball to the wings!

125
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,390
This is great!

126
00:06:52,390 --> 00:06:54,530
Nakanishi-kun is giving very accurate instructions!

127
00:06:54,530 --> 00:06:59,460
Yes! Goalkeepers see the players' movements best because they're positioned at the back!

128
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:01,640
Pass it forward!

129
00:07:02,730 --> 00:07:05,270
The ball goes to forward Ogami-kun.

130
00:07:05,850 --> 00:07:09,740
Center forward Tsubasa-kun has come to steal the ball!

131
00:07:11,110 --> 00:07:12,990
Ogami, make a one-touch pass!

132
00:07:13,460 --> 00:07:14,210
Okay!

133
00:07:14,210 --> 00:07:15,700
Ishizaki-kun, right!

134
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:16,740
Alright!

135
00:07:17,340 --> 00:07:19,290
Ishizaki-kun intercepts!

136
00:07:19,290 --> 00:07:22,250
Tsubasa-kun is one step ahead of Nakanishi-kun's instructions!

137
00:07:22,250 --> 00:07:22,900
What?!

138
00:07:22,900 --> 00:07:23,580
We did it!

139
00:07:23,580 --> 00:07:25,750
Take that, Kisugi!

140
00:07:26,820 --> 00:07:28,000
Nice pass!

141
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:31,590
I feel like I've finally done something useful!

142
00:07:31,590 --> 00:07:33,840
Maeda, support the right wing!

143
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:35,090
Okay!

144
00:07:35,090 --> 00:07:37,260
This is how you make a pass.

145
00:07:37,750 --> 00:07:38,680
Oh no!

146
00:07:39,310 --> 00:07:42,230
Alright! This time I'll definitely score a goal!

147
00:07:42,230 --> 00:07:45,810
Exactly! There's no better goalkeeper than Wakabayashi-san!

148
00:07:45,810 --> 00:07:48,520
Wakabayashi-san would never make such a mistake!

149
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:51,280
Let's support Tsubasa too!

150
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:53,650
Damn it! Everyone fall back!

151
00:07:53,650 --> 00:07:56,440
Stop that brat's advance!

152
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:57,120
Yes!

153
00:07:57,120 --> 00:08:00,540
Naniwa's well-organized defense awaits him.

154
00:08:00,540 --> 00:08:01,830
Tsubasa!

155
00:08:01,830 --> 00:08:03,580
I'm right behind you!

156
00:08:03,580 --> 00:08:06,980
Tsubasa-kun makes a back pass and starts running!

157
00:08:06,980 --> 00:08:07,880
Take it!

158
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:09,660
A wonderful duo play!

159
00:08:09,660 --> 00:08:12,130
Even Naniwa couldn't predict this.

160
00:08:12,130 --> 00:08:15,650
They came from different elementary schools and were former rivals.

161
00:08:15,650 --> 00:08:19,040
But now they have amazing chemistry.

162
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:21,640
Nankatsu SC is a good team.

163
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:24,140
Tsubasa-kun is one-on-one with the goalkeeper.

164
00:08:24,140 --> 00:08:25,060
Bring it on!

165
00:08:25,060 --> 00:08:29,250
He's going to take an early shot from outside the penalty area!

166
00:08:29,250 --> 00:08:30,770
That was too early!

167
00:08:30,770 --> 00:08:31,780
It'll be a waste!

168
00:08:32,260 --> 00:08:35,200
There's no better goalkeeper than Wakabayashi-kun.

169
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:37,030
I'll prove it to you right here where I stand.

170
00:08:39,370 --> 00:08:41,370
Are you stupid?! You acted too early!

171
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:42,830
Got it!

172
00:08:44,210 --> 00:08:47,460
Nakanishi-kun catches it with both hands.

173
00:08:48,510 --> 00:08:50,210
No!

174
00:08:50,210 --> 00:08:52,300
Goal!

175
00:08:52,300 --> 00:08:54,220
A bullet-like goal!

176
00:08:54,890 --> 00:08:55,840
That's it!

177
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:58,820
The ball was spinning incredibly.

178
00:08:58,820 --> 00:09:00,930
Nankatsu equalizes!

179
00:09:00,930 --> 00:09:03,240
Alright! You did it, Tsubasa!

180
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:05,120
He shot from outside the penalty area?

181
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:05,940
What?

182
00:09:05,940 --> 00:09:10,880
During the interschool tournament, Tsubasa scored two goals against you.

183
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:13,780
But you didn't concede from outside the penalty area.

184
00:09:14,690 --> 00:09:19,780
Tsubasa wanted to prove that there's no better goalkeeper than you.

185
00:09:19,780 --> 00:09:25,290
Also, with this, he won't be able to break your record from last year.

186
00:09:25,290 --> 00:09:28,960
Damn it... Just look at that Tsubasa.

187
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:32,670
You're amazing, Tsubasa-kun!

188
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:35,250
With Tsubasa-kun's goal, it's a 1-1 draw.

189
00:09:35,250 --> 00:09:37,170
Nankatsu's forwards are in high spirits!

190
00:09:37,170 --> 00:09:40,620
Misaki-kun is constantly attacking with great ball control!

191
00:09:40,620 --> 00:09:43,060
Nankatsu's forwards are gathering in front of the goal too!

192
00:09:44,190 --> 00:09:46,930
The ball has come to Tsubasa-kun!

193
00:09:46,930 --> 00:09:50,610
Damn it! I won't let you score another goal that easily!

194
00:09:50,610 --> 00:09:53,110
I'll stop him with my whole body!

195
00:09:54,940 --> 00:09:55,650
What?!

196
00:09:55,650 --> 00:09:57,990
The unmarked Kisugi-kun shoots!

197
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,280
He did it!

198
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:02,770
Nankatsu managed to reverse the score!

199
00:10:02,770 --> 00:10:04,080
We did it!

200
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,580
The first half is ending!

201
00:10:06,580 --> 00:10:08,680
Nankatsu, putting incredible pressure on their opponent...

202
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:11,960
...leads 2-1 against Naniwa!

203
00:10:13,590 --> 00:10:16,010
Alright! Let's keep it up, kids!

204
00:10:16,010 --> 00:10:16,750
Okay!

205
00:10:16,750 --> 00:10:19,380
Yes! Even my shot went in!

206
00:10:19,380 --> 00:10:21,430
Their goalkeeper isn't that scary after all.

207
00:10:22,020 --> 00:10:24,450
What's wrong with Nakanishi?

208
00:10:24,450 --> 00:10:26,110
He conceded two goals.

209
00:10:26,110 --> 00:10:27,250
Yes.

210
00:10:27,250 --> 00:10:30,060
They scored two goals against me.

211
00:10:32,570 --> 00:10:35,190
Naniwa's goalkeeper isn't at fault.

212
00:10:35,190 --> 00:10:37,760
Nankatsu is truly very strong.

213
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:41,820
They've improved a lot compared to when they played against us.

214
00:10:41,820 --> 00:10:46,540
Nankatsu's attacks continued in the second half.

215
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:51,370
Since the tournament started, the team's level has been constantly rising.

216
00:10:51,370 --> 00:10:57,880
Aware of this, Tsubasa is not only improving himself but also his teammates.

217
00:10:57,880 --> 00:11:01,130
You've grown a lot, Tsubasa.

218
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:03,680
Nankatsu scores their 4th goal!

219
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:09,220
Conceding goal after goal, Nakanishi-kun seems to have lost his determination!

220
00:11:09,220 --> 00:11:10,310
Damn it...

221
00:11:10,310 --> 00:11:14,310
I've been completely defeated in this match.

222
00:11:14,310 --> 00:11:18,900
But Ozora Tsubasa... You went too far by shaming me.

223
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:21,820
I'll make you pay for this!

224
00:11:21,820 --> 00:11:24,570
Tsubasa-kun is quickly approaching the goal!

225
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:28,290
Tsubasa-kun is preparing to shoot!

226
00:11:28,290 --> 00:11:33,080
I'll take that golden right foot from you!

227
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:36,100
Take this!

228
00:11:36,750 --> 00:11:41,420
Tsubasa-kun narrowly escapes Nakanishi-kun's attack!

229
00:11:45,850 --> 00:11:48,040
A flawless goal!

230
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:51,810
5-1! Tsubasa-kun scores another one!

231
00:11:51,810 --> 00:11:53,810
We did it!

232
00:11:56,540 --> 00:12:00,680
Nakanishi-kun, if instead of attacking you had tried to catch the ball...

233
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:02,870
...maybe you could have saved this one.

234
00:12:10,910 --> 00:12:13,620
I've been completely defeated.

235
00:12:15,530 --> 00:12:17,720
The final whistle of the match also blows.

236
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:20,130
Nankatsu is in the top 8!

237
00:12:19,170 --> 00:12:20,130
Nankatsu SC: 5 - 1: Naniwa FC

238
00:12:20,130 --> 00:12:21,210
One, two...

239
00:12:21,210 --> 00:12:23,440
You did it, Nankatsu!

240
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:25,380
Come on, become champions!

241
00:12:25,380 --> 00:12:28,220
Nankatsu SC is getting stronger and stronger.

242
00:12:28,220 --> 00:12:30,980
A team you can't take your eyes off.

243
00:12:31,850 --> 00:12:34,660
That's to be expected from Captain Tsubasa-kun.

244
00:12:34,660 --> 00:12:39,230
In the role of his team's main pillar, he balances everything.

245
00:12:39,230 --> 00:12:44,740
It seems we can't win against them unless I play from start to finish.

246
00:12:45,290 --> 00:12:46,490
Captain...

247
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:56,220
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

248
00:12:56,920 --> 00:13:01,370
In tomorrow's semi-finals, from the 8 teams...

249
00:13:01,370 --> 00:13:03,130
...the best 4 will be determined.

250
00:13:04,180 --> 00:13:10,260
Meiwa FC and Furano Elementary advanced after fierce matches.

251
00:13:04,650 --> 00:13:05,290
Meiwa FC: 5 - 1: Kozai Elementary

252
00:13:08,220 --> 00:13:10,260
Furano Elementary: 3 - 1: Bizen FC

253
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:14,330
As for our Nankatsu, they defeated Shinjo by a huge margin...

254
00:13:13,290 --> 00:13:17,600
Nankatsu SC: 7 - 0: Shinjo FC

255
00:13:14,330 --> 00:13:17,600
...and secured a place in the top four.

256
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,600
Everyone, well done.

257
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:22,950
The winner of today's Musashi and Hitachi match...

258
00:13:22,950 --> 00:13:25,610
...will be our opponent tomorrow.

259
00:13:25,610 --> 00:13:27,880
If everything goes smoothly...

260
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:30,250
Unless there's a mishap, Musashi will probably win, right?

261
00:13:30,250 --> 00:13:30,950
Yes.

262
00:13:30,950 --> 00:13:34,590
Musashi FC, the representative of the Kanto region.

263
00:13:34,590 --> 00:13:38,210
Their players are top-tier individuals selected from among 1000 people.

264
00:13:38,210 --> 00:13:43,840
The most notable person on their team is their captain, Misugi Jun.

265
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:46,630
His technique is far above the elementary school level.

266
00:13:46,630 --> 00:13:49,200
Others can't even make physical contact with him, let alone beat him.

267
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:51,160
With his graceful playing style...

268
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:54,470
He's called the Young Ace of the Field. Right, Coach?

269
00:13:54,470 --> 00:13:55,620
Wow...

270
00:13:55,620 --> 00:13:59,910
But he hasn't even played a single match in the tournament yet.

271
00:13:59,910 --> 00:14:01,610
Maybe he's injured or something.

272
00:14:01,610 --> 00:14:03,830
No. I don't know the reason, but...

273
00:14:03,830 --> 00:14:07,440
...Misugi always plays very little in matches.

274
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:08,110
What?

275
00:14:08,110 --> 00:14:10,110
That's why all the girls...

276
00:14:10,110 --> 00:14:13,960
Kyaaa >.< Misugi-san is so mysterious! How wonderful!

277
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:15,680
are saying.

278
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:17,620
It's just hot air.

279
00:14:17,620 --> 00:14:23,260
Musashi advanced from the group thanks to teamwork, but...

280
00:14:23,260 --> 00:14:27,280
...if they're going to play against us, I'm sure they'll play Misugi too.

281
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:28,850
We'd expect that.

282
00:14:28,850 --> 00:14:31,700
We'll definitely win and advance to the finals!

283
00:14:31,700 --> 00:14:33,510
For Wakabayashi-san's sake too!

284
00:14:33,510 --> 00:14:34,850
Yes!

285
00:14:34,850 --> 00:14:36,650
Hey, Misugi-san!

286
00:14:36,650 --> 00:14:38,650
The semi-finals are practically here.

287
00:14:38,650 --> 00:14:41,110
Misugi-kun, what's your status for playing?

288
00:14:41,110 --> 00:14:42,880
Who knows?

289
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:47,690
If you win this, you'll play against Nankatsu SC, who are ambitious for the championship.

290
00:14:47,690 --> 00:14:51,190
Nankatsu is strong. Especially Ozora Tsubasa-kun.

291
00:14:51,190 --> 00:14:54,520
I'd like to compete with him and test our talents.

292
00:14:54,520 --> 00:14:55,050
What?

293
00:14:55,050 --> 00:14:56,700
So can we be sure you'll play?

294
00:14:56,700 --> 00:15:00,560
Misugi-san, will you not play until the Nankatsu match?

295
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:03,270
But if they get into a difficult situation, maybe he'll play today too.

296
00:15:03,270 --> 00:15:06,710
Then the opposing team, Hitachi FC, needs to do their best.

297
00:15:06,710 --> 00:15:10,280
Hora! Hora! Hitachi!

298
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:12,470
Hora! Hora! Hitachi!

299
00:15:12,470 --> 00:15:16,980
Damn Misugi! He's completely ignoring us!

300
00:15:16,980 --> 00:15:19,060
Let's show him what we can do.

301
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:21,810
What do you mean, Misugi?

302
00:15:21,810 --> 00:15:26,360
Coach, this tournament is very special to me.

303
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:28,480
You're aware of that, aren't you?

304
00:15:29,860 --> 00:15:33,610
I know myself best.

305
00:15:33,610 --> 00:15:37,400
Do you want to play against Ozora Tsubasa that much?

306
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:38,290
Yes.

307
00:15:38,290 --> 00:15:41,200
I can't fully understand your feelings, but...

308
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:43,580
...I can't let you play that easily.

309
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:48,090
You'll sit calmly on the bench today. We'll talk about this later.

310
00:15:48,640 --> 00:15:49,910
Understood.

311
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:56,140
Manager?

312
00:15:58,470 --> 00:16:01,680
What a crowd has gathered.

313
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:05,100
It's because Musashi FC attracts a lot of attention.

314
00:16:05,100 --> 00:16:06,580
Tsubasa-kun.

315
00:16:07,570 --> 00:16:09,300
Yayoi-chan!

316
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:11,820
We need to talk a bit.

317
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:17,440
Are we traveling by truck again now?

318
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:17,870
What?

319
00:16:20,790 --> 00:16:23,290
Tsubasa-kun is with that girl?!

320
00:16:23,290 --> 00:16:25,750
What are those two talking about?!

321
00:16:25,750 --> 00:16:26,670
Tsubasa-kun!

322
00:16:27,490 --> 00:16:28,600
Are you jeal--

323
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:30,150
No, I can't forgive this!

324
00:16:30,150 --> 00:16:32,420
I haven't even touched him yet!

325
00:16:32,420 --> 00:16:34,120
Tsubasa-kun, please!

326
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:36,350
Let our captain win!

327
00:16:36,350 --> 00:16:39,930
The captain can no longer play football because of his weak heart.

328
00:16:39,930 --> 00:16:41,020
What?!

329
00:16:41,290 --> 00:16:42,180
What?!

330
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:45,190
He can't play football anymore?

331
00:16:45,190 --> 00:16:51,590
The doctors wanted him to wait until this tournament is over no matter what.

332
00:16:51,590 --> 00:16:53,960
Is that why he doesn't play in matches?

333
00:16:53,960 --> 00:16:57,410
Only the coach and I know this truth.

334
00:16:58,870 --> 00:17:03,360
Please! This is the last tournament of his life!

335
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:07,170
That's why, no matter what, let him win tomorrow's match.

336
00:17:07,170 --> 00:17:08,560
I can't do that.

337
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:10,920
Tsubasa-kun...

338
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:14,710
Winning this tournament is part of my dream.

339
00:17:14,710 --> 00:17:18,590
If I achieve it, Roberto and I have decided that I'll go to Brazil.

340
00:17:18,590 --> 00:17:20,770
What? Brazil?

341
00:17:20,770 --> 00:17:23,890
Yes. The country of football, Brazil!

342
00:17:23,890 --> 00:17:27,690
That way, I can become a professional football player there!

343
00:17:27,690 --> 00:17:31,360
Therefore, I can't accept losing, no matter who my opponent is!

344
00:17:32,190 --> 00:17:37,360
I'm sure Misugi-kun would also be happier if I fight with all my might.

345
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:39,490
Tsubasa-kun...

346
00:17:44,040 --> 00:17:49,420
Goal! Hitachi catches up from behind in the 5th minute of the second half!

347
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:51,420
We did it! We did it!

348
00:17:51,860 --> 00:17:53,340
Coach! I'm going!

349
00:17:54,100 --> 00:17:56,310
Misugi... You...

350
00:17:56,310 --> 00:18:00,180
If we lose here and everything ends, I can't play against Nankatsu.

351
00:18:00,180 --> 00:18:01,470
Please.

352
00:18:02,030 --> 00:18:02,890
What can we do now?

353
00:18:02,890 --> 00:18:06,560
But if you get worse, return to the bench immediately.

354
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:08,020
Thank you very much!

355
00:18:08,020 --> 00:18:10,520
Falling behind, Musashi...

356
00:18:10,520 --> 00:18:15,030
...brings in their star Misugi-kun for Yamamoto-kun.

357
00:18:15,030 --> 00:18:18,030
Misugi-san!

358
00:18:18,030 --> 00:18:19,380
Captain!

359
00:18:19,380 --> 00:18:20,920
Captain, take this.

360
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:21,700
Okay.

361
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:24,490
Finally, Misugi comes on.

362
00:18:25,110 --> 00:18:27,000
Misugi-kun...

363
00:18:28,710 --> 00:18:30,960
Misugi! Do your best!

364
00:18:36,800 --> 00:18:38,670
The ball has arrived!

365
00:18:38,670 --> 00:18:42,040
This is Musashi's number 14, Misugi Jun-kun!

366
00:18:42,040 --> 00:18:47,430
It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say that Musashi's game starts and ends with Misugi-kun.

367
00:18:47,430 --> 00:18:49,490
Damn it! Who cares if it's Misugi?!

368
00:18:49,490 --> 00:18:51,280
No matter how good he is...

369
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:53,230
...he's just a kid our age, isn't he?!

370
00:18:53,940 --> 00:18:55,900
He's dribbling like poetry!

371
00:18:55,900 --> 00:18:56,360
What?!

372
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:58,720
Incredible footwork!

373
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:02,030
