382
00:19:20,250 --> 00:19:22,800
They are dominating the flow of the game!

383
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:23,890
Ichinose!

384
00:19:25,100 --> 00:19:27,010
Pass to Honma on the right wing immediately!

385
00:19:27,010 --> 00:19:27,930
Okay!

386
00:19:27,930 --> 00:19:29,820
Pass back to Sanada in midfield!

387
00:19:29,820 --> 00:19:30,520
Okay!

388
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:35,290
With his dribbling, passing, and game control, Misugi-kun...

389
00:19:35,290 --> 00:19:37,970
...proves he is the keystone of Musashi FC!

390
00:19:39,190 --> 00:19:40,690
