391
00:19:40,690 --> 00:19:41,490
Okay!

392
00:19:41,490 --> 00:19:42,140
Captain!

393
00:19:42,140 --> 00:19:45,240
Misugi-kun runs forward and takes a long shot.

394
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:49,350
Goal! 10th minute of the second half.

395
00:19:49,350 --> 00:19:52,250
Musashi makes a wonderful comeback in the blink of an eye!

396
00:19:52,250 --> 00:19:55,170
And the game of the magnificent Misugi-kun gets better and better!

397
00:19:55,170 --> 00:19:57,360
Truly the Young Ace of the Field!

398
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:58,050
Amazing.

399
00:19:58,050 --> 00:20:02,050
Can Misugi-kun play like this despite his heart condition?

400
00:20:02,970 --> 00:20:04,550
The match is over!

401
00:20:05,490 --> 00:20:10,630
In the last match of the quarter-finals, Musashi beat Hitachi 6-2.

402
