He has a good playing style that allows him to show his talents comfortably.

416
00:21:03,840 --> 00:21:07,820
And most importantly, Tsubasa-kun loves football.

417
00:21:07,820 --> 00:21:13,350
I'm sure Tsubasa-kun will transcend Japan's borders and become a world-class footballer.

